# sunshine — local PKGBUILD (packages/sunshine/PKGBUILD). Not in holo or Arch. Builds its own
# trimmed static FFmpeg from the build-deps submodule the release pins, and a static miniupnpc;
# see the PKGBUILD header for why neither comes from the snapshot.
#
# Patches:
#   0001  KMS capture takes each output's bottom plane and follows it, counting monitors per CRTC.
#         gamescope scans out the app and its overlays on separate planes and composes them into
#         one only when it has to; capture took the overlay plane, so the stream went black. To
#         offer upstream.
#   0002  A panel scanned out at a 90-degree plane rotation (Pocket Max) swaps the output's sides,
#         as 270 (Steam Deck) already did; it was cropped to its left square. To offer upstream.
name: sunshine
pkgbuild_local: PKGBUILD
pkgrel_suffix: 1
patches: 0001-kmsgrab-capture-each-output-s-bottom-plane.patch 0002-kmsgrab-swap-the-output-s-sides-for-a-90-degree-pane.patch
